    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>This plugin allows you to add a customizable floating channel button to your WordPress site that links to your preferred communication channel.<br />\nSee live demo here: <a href=\"https://tutorialsbynitin.com/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Tutorials by Nitin</a></p>\n<p><strong>Features:</strong><br />\n&#8211; Supports any public channel link<br />\n&#8211; Lightweight and easy setup<br />\n&#8211; Floating channel icon<br />\n&#8211; Admin settings for channel URL</p>\n<h3>Credits</h3>\n<p>Developed by Tutorials by Nitin – <a href=\"https://tutorialsbynitin.com\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">https://tutorialsbynitin.com</a></p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the plugin ZIP file via the WordPress admin panel or extract into <code>/wp-content/plugins/floating-chat-channel-button/</code></li>\n<li>Activate via the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; menu in WordPress.</li>\n<li>Go to <strong>Settings <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">→</span> Channel Button</strong></li>\n<li>Enter your messaging or broadcast channel URL</li>\n<li>Save changes and enjoy!</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='can%20i%20link%20to%20any%20platform%3F'>\nCan I link to any platform?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes! Use links from any messaging or chat platforms (e.g., Telegram, WhatsApp, Messenger).</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='can%20i%20change%20the%20icon%20or%20position%3F'>\nCan I change the icon or position?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>You can modify the CSS file to customize the button appearance.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='does%20this%20plugin%20support%20shortcode%3F'>\nDoes this plugin support shortcode?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>No, this version uses a floating global button only.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Minor improvements and bug fixes</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Add a floating button that links to any messaging or broadcast channel. Supports Telegram, WhatsApp, and more.",
    "description": "<p>This plugin allows you to add a customizable floating channel button to your WordPress site that links to your preferred communication channel.<br />\nSee live demo here: <a href=\"https://tutorialsbynitin.com/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Tutorials by Nitin</a></p>\n<p><strong>Features:</strong><br />\n&#8211; Supports any public channel link<br />\n&#8211; Lightweight and easy setup<br />\n&#8211; Floating channel icon<br />\n&#8211; Admin settings for channel URL</p>\n<h3>Credits</h3>\n<p>Developed by Tutorials by Nitin – <a href=\"https://tutorialsbynitin.com\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">https://tutorialsbynitin.com</a></p>\n",
